# Run artifacts (models/<date>/model.json, eval_report.json, eval_report.md)
# are local outputs of train.py, not source -- same treatment CLAUDE.md gives
# cron_tracking/ and artifacts/ for the core repo. Keep this directory itself
# tracked via .gitkeep so a fresh checkout has somewhere for train.py to
# write into.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
